.TH LIBMPQ__FILE_FINISH 3 2026-08-18 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__file_finish \- finish a streamed MPQ file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <libmpq/mpq.h>
.PP
.B int32_t libmpq__file_finish(mpq_writer_s *writer);
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validates the declared size, writes the file sectors and records its hash and
block entry. Incomplete streams are rejected.
